Milo wants the mosaic to be **3 inches tall**. Since the area of a rectangle is given by:

$$
\text{Area} = \text{Length} \times \text{Height}
$$

We can solve for **length**:

$$
\text{Length} = \frac{\text{Area}}{\text{Height}} = \frac{12}{3} = 4 \text{ inches}
$$

