$$
7 \text{ packs} \times 8 \text{ glue sticks per pack} = 56 \text{ glue sticks}
$$

This is more than enough, and it also satisfies the condition of having some extra glue sticks left over. Therefore, the correct answer is:

$$
\boxed{7}
