I need to find out how much Keenan spends per week on groceries, given that Madeline and Keenan share the cost of groceries, and they spend a total of $400 per month. Madeline pays 60% of the cost.

First, I calculate Keenan's monthly share of the cost. Since Madeline pays 60%, Keenan pays the remaining 40% of the total cost. The total cost per month is $400, so Keenan's monthly share is:
