0.40 \times 400 = 160 \text{ dollars}
$$

Next, I convert this monthly amount into a weekly amount. Since the month is four weeks long, I divide Keenan's monthly share by 4:
$$
160 \div 4 = 40 \text{ dollars per week}
$$

